WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:03.379
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie.

00:00:03.379 --> 00:00:05.170
Welcome back to my season 4 countdown. 13
more days to go.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:09.290
the other day in my Game of Thrones Movie
video I asked you all to submit questions

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:13.190
about the back end of the series and possible
movie stories.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:17.050
So I picked 10 to answer in this video and
one bonus question.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:23.609
If you’re just now finding me I’m doing
a special countdown to the season 4 premiere.

00:00:23.609 --> 00:00:29.319
Once that starts I’ll be doing weekly videos
just like my Walking Dead stuff and a weekly

00:00:29.319 --> 00:00:30.319
giveaway.

00:00:30.319 --> 00:00:35.710
Make sure to subscribe to get everything and
feel free to suggest topics for bonus videos.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:36.899
Let’s answer so questions.

00:00:36.899 --> 00:00:39.350
Careful for potential spoilers.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:43.629
Most of this is about prequel material.

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:45.510
So it shouldn’t be a huge deal.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:52.539
Question 1 - Lady Cersei asks How much will
Jaime’s perspective differ from the books?﻿

00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:55.500
Just because the timeline is messed up a little?

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.269
So in the books Jaime doesn’t get back to
King’s Landing till way later in the story.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.489
Meaning he’s going to be there to witness
some things.

00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:07.750
In all honesty, they way they’ve been developing
all the characters involved.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.640
I don’t think his character will feel or
act any differently than he did in the books.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.229
There will be a few new scenes.

00:01:14.229 --> 00:01:19.390
That didn’t happen in the books, but only
for continuity with the story the show is

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:20.390
telling.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.590
So short answer, for the most part, he’ll
still be the same.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:25.150
His character arc won’t change.

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:32.409
Whic is good, because he’s going to be one
of my favorite characters this season.

00:01:32.409 --> 00:01:37.020
Question 2 - Neto del Toro asks How many movies
do you think they could get out of the dance

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.820
of the dragons story?

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:43.189
For those who don’t know, the dance of the
dragons was a Targaryen civil war that took

00:01:43.189 --> 00:01:46.600
place a long time before events on the show.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:50.960
I think they could totally turn into int a
Lord of The Rings, Hobbit Trilogy.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:55.049
That seems to be the style now a days with
these huge epic adaptations.

00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:57.080
Turn what would normally be one movie into
three.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.679
And make three times as much money.

00:01:58.679 --> 00:02:00.219
Not that I would complain if they did that.

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:03.420
It would mean an extra 4-5 years of movies.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.840
Assuming they start with one trilogy.

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:09.399
I think if they did a movie though, they would
start with the characters currently on the

00:02:09.399 --> 00:02:10.399
show.

00:02:10.399 --> 00:02:16.330
Just to give George RR Martin time to finish
Dream of Spring.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:20.420
Question 3 - Shihab Shabbir asks What do you
think the upcoming game of thrones game will

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.420
be about?﻿

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:24.970
If you’re talking about the one Telltale
Games is working on, it will involve the current

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:25.970
characters.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:26.970
Starting with the first book.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:29.860
They’ll probably expand on events and give
us a chance to see battles and places that

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:31.410
don’t appear in the books.

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.140
Or events that are only mentioned briefly.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:36.870
It’s possible that they could also do a
prequel story in a future season too.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.520
Telltale’s Walking Dead game used a different
character than the tv series.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:45.010
But either way, they’re a great company
and I’ll be making gameplay videos when

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.010
it comes.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.010
It’s not being released till December this
year.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.010
So that’s a long ways off.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:50.610
I’ll try to get my hands on a pre-release
copy though.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:56.010
Question 4 - Alex Garcia asks What are the
chances of seeing a #GOT Robert's Rebellion

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:59.560
series that would fill in the gaps of Jon
Snow's birth?﻿

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:02.370
I think it’s more likely that they’d tell
that in a flashback.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.570
Rather than dedicate an entire movie to it.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:08.490
Any movie would really just tie up whatever
they didn’t have time for in the final season.

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.790
Or setup a spinoff franchise like Dunk and
Egg.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:16.060
I think Jon Snow will find out who his mother
is before the end of the series.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:19.110
Whether he figures it out himself or someone
tells him.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:23.430
Question 5 - Matthew Blanche (no avatar) asks
do you think the show will start hinting at

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.060
big events that haven't appeared in the novels
yet?﻿

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.320
You’re talking about if the show starts
to pass the books.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:33.310
Martin said he think’s he’s got through
season 5 before that happens.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:37.380
By which time he’ll have finished Winds
of Winter, giving him about two more seasons.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:41.130
It’s really not until we get to Season 7
that he’s in trouble.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.200
It’s way too soon to tell, but remember
Martin told David Benioff and DB Weiss what

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.910
the ending was in case that happened.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:50.840
They just needed to know because they’re
already planning season 5 and they don’t

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:54.462
want to kill a character that’s really important
later in the story.

00:03:54.462 --> 00:03:59.010
And it helps them know where everyone needs
to be moving forward.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.010
So short answer, yes.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.680
They’ll pass Martin, but not for a couple
more seasons.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.820
Question 6 - Christina Barton asks how do
you put all the info in your videos?

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:12.920
Hey nice channel, thanks for asking about
how I make videos.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.890
Normally I already have an idea of what I
want to say and then I just do research in

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.449
books and forums to get facts straight.

00:04:18.449 --> 00:04:23.460
It’s not super complicated, but if I’m
making a really long video with a lot of information.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.810
It takes a long time to collect all those
facts.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:31.990
And I don’t read from a teleprompter, but
I do write what I want to say down.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:36.360
Just to get it straight in my head.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.259
And so I can make subtitles.

00:04:38.259 --> 00:04:42.199
Question 7 - Vermalgab Boom asks Has there
been anything written about the Doom?﻿

00:04:42.199 --> 00:04:47.199
Yes, but the book called “The World of Ice
And Fire” isn’t being released till October

00:04:47.199 --> 00:04:48.199
this year.

00:04:48.199 --> 00:04:50.810
So you can read more about Ancient Valyria
in that.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.610
I’ll be sure to do a review when it comes
out.

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:57.259
Martin is also writing a book called “Fire
and Blood”.

00:04:57.259 --> 00:05:02.410
And it’s the complete history of House Targaryen,
which existed in Old Valyria.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:06.219
That book won’t be written till after Dream
of Spring though.

00:05:06.219 --> 00:05:11.470
Question 8 - Bang Maid asks Did GRRM indicate
whether the movies would be continued under

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.229
the supervision of Benioff and Weiss?

00:05:13.229 --> 00:05:15.780
No, he didn’t say anything about that.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:19.660
And they just re-upped their contract with
HBO for season 5.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:24.120
Which means that it’s possible, but not
likely that they could leave the show before

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.120
it’s over.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.120
I don’t think that’s going to happen.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:30.560
It’s been so successful under them that
there’s no reason for them to leave.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.389
Unless HBO refuses to pay them more money.

00:05:33.389 --> 00:05:39.729
Question 9 - Chris B asks which two characters
would you most like to see meet each other?

00:05:39.729 --> 00:05:40.729
﻿

00:05:40.729 --> 00:05:42.889
Daenerys, Jon Snow and Tyrion.

00:05:42.889 --> 00:05:46.150
My own person dream team for the Three Heads
of the Dragon.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:50.270
Even if that’s not necessarily the way the
prophecy will go down.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:54.520
Tyrion studies a lot of dragonlore, so I think
he’ll be associated with the dragons at

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.780
some point.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.060
Whether or not he gets to ride one.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.819
We’ll have to see.

00:05:58.819 --> 00:06:03.710
Question 10 - Candoran2 (no avatar) asks How
does one become a greenseer?﻿

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:10.430
So one person in a thousand is born a skinchanger,
people that can Warg.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:17.569
And one Skinchanger in a thousand is born
a greenseer.

00:06:17.569 --> 00:06:23.030
On the show, the three eyed raven is the only
greenseer in the world, Bran is the next one.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:26.740
That’s why it’s so easy for him to warg
into people like Hodor.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.189
Normal skinchangers can’t do that.

00:06:29.189 --> 00:06:32.880
Based on the images in the trailer, we’re
going to see a lot of the greenseer story

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.020
play out.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:38.819
Who else was disappointed when the eyes on
the weirwood tree didn’t open.

00:06:38.819 --> 00:06:45.530
Bonus Question - Melanie Rojas asks do you
subscribe to the R+L theory of Jon Snow’s

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:46.530
parents?

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.530
I do, yes.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:53.849
For the simple reason that it lines up logically
with what we know about all those characters

00:06:53.849 --> 00:06:55.220
and the timeline of events during Robert’s
Rebellion.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:07:01.129
And it would put Jon Snow in a very specific
place going into the battle with the great

00:07:01.129 --> 00:07:02.129
other.

00:07:02.129 --> 00:07:09.120
As in it would validate a lot of the azor
ahai and three heads of the dragon theories.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.990
It would also get him tied up in ancient blood
magic which just sounds so awesome.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.720
For all intents and purposes.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:19.460
His character would just be 10 times more
interesting if the R+L theory is true.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:23.220
It’s the most logical guess given the facts
we have.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:28.650
DB Weiss and David Benioff were able to guess
it immediately after reading the first four

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.650
books.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.249
So it’s not a super mystery.

00:07:31.249 --> 00:07:36.479
Anyone is welcome to pose alternate theories,
but thanks so much for submitting your questions.

00:07:36.479 --> 00:07:40.469
My next countdown video will probably be my
top 10 moments from season 3.

00:07:40.469 --> 00:07:43.539
But feel free to leave me suggestions in the
comments below.

00:07:43.539 --> 00:07:46.849
Right now click here to learn about the history
of dragons in the world and click here for

00:07:46.849 --> 00:07:48.819
the rest of my season 4 countdown videos.

00:07:48.819 --> 00:07:50.530
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.159
High Fives!

